ct(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..<span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">ContactPoint</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Contacto técnico del proveedor para incidentes de disponibilidad y de seguridad.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Endpoint.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal-definitions.html#Endpoint.period\">period</a><a name=\"Endpoint.period\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Period\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Period</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Vigencia del mecanismo, cuando el proveedor la declara.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Endpoint.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal-definitions.html#Endpoint.payloadType\">payloadType</a><a name=\"Endpoint.payloadType\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Para visores y portales, endpoint-payload-type#none: el portal no envía contenido clínico, sólo invoca.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Endpoint.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal-definitions.html#Endpoint.payloadMimeType\">payloadMimeType</a><a name=\"Endpoint.payloadMimeType\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#code\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">code</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Mimetype to send. If not specified, the content could be anything (including no payload, if the connectionType defined this)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Endpoint.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal-definitions.html#Endpoint.address\">address</a><a name=\"Endpoint.address\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #B60000\" title=\"This element must be supported\">S</span><span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\"> This element must be supported. </span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#url\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">url</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">URL base HTTPS del mecanismo, sin parámetros de consulta: URL base de IID, URL base de la API o URL de entrada del portal.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Endpoint.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal-definitions.html#Endpoint.header\" class=\"xhtPieceStrikeout\">header</a><a name=\"Endpoint.header\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceStrikeout\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceStrikeout xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceStrikeout\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceStrikeout\">0</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Usage depends on the channel type</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table></div>"
  ] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.url [ fhir:value "https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/imagenologia/StructureDefinition/EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.version [ fhir:value "0.5.0"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.name [ fhir:value "EndpointAccesoImagenesMinsal"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.title [ fhir:value "Endpoint de Acceso a Imágenes MINSAL"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.status [ fhir:value "draft"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.date [ fhir:value "2026-11-02T11:03:04-03:00"^^xsd:dateTime] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.publisher [ fhir:value "Unidad de Interoperabilidad - MINSAL"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.contact [
     fhir:index 0 ;
     fhir:ContactDetail.name [ fhir:value "Unidad de Interoperabilidad - MINSAL" ] ;
     fhir:ContactDetail.telecom [
       fhir:index 0 ;
       fhir:ContactPoint.system [ fhir:value "url" ] ;
       fhir:ContactPoint.value [ fhir:value "https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl" ]
     ]
  ] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.description [ fhir:value "Declaración, por parte de un proveedor RIS/PACS, del mecanismo mediante el cual un paciente accede a las imágenes de sus estudios en la infraestructura de origen: IHE Invoke Image Display (modalidad A), API del proveedor (modalidad B) o portal web del proveedor (modalidad C). El connectionType determina la modalidad y, con ella, el nivel de conformidad (D-020). El recurso describe la dirección del servicio; el contexto del estudio y los mecanismos de autenticación y autorización se resuelven en tiempo de ejecución y no se almacenan aquí. Un mismo Endpoint es referenciado por todos los estudios del proveedor que se acceden por ese mecanismo."] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.jurisdiction [
     fhir:index 0 ;
     fhir:CodeableConcept.coding [
       fhir:index 0 ;
       fhir:Coding.system [ fhir:value "urn:iso:std:iso:3166" ] ;
       fhir:Coding.code [ fhir:value "CL" ] ;
       fhir:Coding.display [ fhir:value "Chile" ]
     ]
  ] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.fhirVersion [ fhir:value "4.0.1"] ;
  fhir:StructureDefinition.mapping [
     fhir:index 0 ;
